<title>GERMANY: Germany sees better economy but no jobs turnaround.</title>
<headline>Germany sees better economy but no jobs turnaround.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG, Germany 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Labour Office President Bernhard Jagoda said on Tuesday that Germany's economic recovery was continuing but that there were still no signs of a turnaround on the labour market.</p>
<p>&quot;We are seeing signs of stability particularly in west Germany,&quot; he said in a statement. &quot;Economic improvements are progressing but there is still no turnaround on the jobs market.&quot;</p>
</text>
